00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:55.620
"He's s-

00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:56.200
(hears stippy-steps)

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.060
-kulking in the darkness,

00:00:58.060 --> 00:01:01.640
